# <%= current_page.data.title %>

## Overview

In a nutshell, a web-based API Catalogue.

## Getting started

We'll know better once we build our first prototype. We're going to build a GOV.UK styled
API Catalogue to trial our approach. We're happy to take feedback through 
`#ask-integration-hub`.

## Adding an API

Undecided! We put together a non-functional flow in Miro with a simple flow: describe the
API, populate the ownership data, then allow customers to check their answers before
submitting them.

## Discovering APIs

Also undecided! In our non-functional Miro flow we assumed users would want to search
based perhaps on API name, or against the description of what the API does.

We expect to expose the stored OpenAPI specificiation if it's available.

## Maintaining the catalogue

This will need some way to map ownership - perhaps through an Entra group membership - and
attach that to the API metadata so that only the Integration Hub team and API Owner team
can maintain it.

## Get help

Come and talk to us on Slack - `#ask-integration-hub`.
